again, I'd like to request a chibi piece with my 原神 OC Seline and the NPC Diluc (ディルック).\n\nFor the pose, could I request Diluc giving Seline a bouquet of roses and a heart-shaped box of chocolates? He would be very bashful about it so I imagine he would have a blushing face.\nSeline is very aware that he's very shy about relationships and public displays of affection. So I think she would have a gentle smiling face. Her cheeks would be flushed pink because she is happy.\n\nI will leave the background details to you, but maybe this could be during the Windblume festival? Feel free to pick a different background if it's easier.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration! Thank you for the fantastic art as always!\n\nSeline reference: https://imgur.com/a/xvrkoo0\nDiluc reference: https://imgur.com/a/nHe351T\n\nFestival/background reference: https://imgur.com/a/QSt6Svs\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/xvrkoo0", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@moka_ko601/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2558852, "client_id": 2403587, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b78aaa7f/uploads/origins/8ab323e4-74b8-40ba-aac4-0c55c7be1d46?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9e2b4a3323bef6f05b4a78561e76bb15", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b78aaa7f/uploads/origins/8ab323e4-74b8-40ba-aac4-0c55c7be1d46?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9e2b4a3323bef6f05b4a78561e76bb15, https://si.imgix.net/b78aaa7f/uploads/origins/8ab323e4-74b8-40ba-aac4-0c55c7be1d46?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0118fa0435f6b9933d39dabc54edad99 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b78aaa7f/uploads/origins/8ab323e4-74b8-40ba-aac4-0c55c7be1d46?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cb6b8a6ca4a4b81a7908e165cd7