let you pick what they are doing. Maybe have them strolling around holding hands, or releasing lanterns together? I would like their expressions to be happy or loving.\n\nKey feature: Seline has blue eyes like the 4th reference image. \n\nThank you for your time and consideration!\n\nDiluc reference: https://imgur.com/a/nHe351T\nSeline reference: https://imgur.com/a/l912h9B\n\nFestival/background reference: https://imgur.com/a/vd0AkmG\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/l912h9B", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@moka_ko601/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2558852, "client_id": 2253287, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1932401b/uploads/origins/2c03a0fa-d06c-4584-bb4f-7b57c4a0f69e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=75014ca9a172dbf354734a986c41d70d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1932401b/uploads/origins/2c03a0fa-d06c-4584-bb4f-7b57c4a0f69e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=75014ca9a172dbf354734a986c41d70d, https://si.imgix.net/1932401b/uploads/origins/2c03a0fa-d06c-4584-bb4f-7b57c4a0f69e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2e4db135ca9d96740e5f3e79fd679d2f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1932401b/uploads/origins/2c03a0fa-d06c-4584-bb4f-7b57c4a0f69e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9e226144aeea6c20319f151c411f8f82 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1932401b/uploads/origins/2c03a0fa-d06c-4584-bb4f-7b57c4a0f69e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a32abf08395a16d193478217bf782fbb", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1932401b/uploads/origins/2c03a0fa-d06c-4584-bb4f-7b57c4a0f69e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a32abf08395a16d193478217bf782fbb, https://si.imgix.net/1932401b/uploads/origins/2c03a0fa-d06c-4584-bb4f-7b57c4a0f69e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5cace6c1b7f1cbb1e128825d96792538 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1932401b/uploads/origins/2c03a0fa-d06c-4584-bb4f-7b57c4a0f69e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d8d5786f9d979934dd36e5c0b740ef7f 3x"}, "body": "Thank you very much for your help.\nI would like to request the following illustration.\n\nContents\nI would like to request an illustration of Ruu Hoshikai, VTuber.\n\nSituation\nI would like to see Ruu playing a game in her room.\n\nDetails\nI would like you to draw her playing games in her room in her new outfit (gamer girl style loungewear) that was released on February 11 to commemorate her first anniversary.\n　⇒Please send us a drawing of her in that outfit playing games in her room. https://twitter.com/hoshimi_ruu/status/1624394578983022593\n\nI would like to have a drawing of her playing games in her room in this outfit.\n　⇒https://www.pixiv.net/artworks/104050851\n\nIf it is not too difficult, please draw her long hair, which is her favorite. If it is difficult, please use the long hair that you prefer.\n　If it is too difficult, please draw your favorite long hair.\n　⇒https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f9QIquqyTYM\n　　Short hair: around 34:30\n　　Twin-tail hair: around 44:25\n　　Long hair: around 51:10\n\nWe are very sorry, but we would like to ask for your permission to post the illustrations on twitter and to use them in your own activities (distribution, SNS, etc.).\nWe would appreciate your consideration.\n\nAbout Ruu Hoshikai\nYouTube\n　⇒https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCnB3wFyiJHQzX22_WE7-91Q\n\ntwitter\n　⇒https://twitter.com/hoshimi_ruu\n\nThank you very much for your time and detailed requests.\nThank you for your cooperation.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/hoshimi_ruu/status/1565539450771640320", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@moka_ko601/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2558852, "client_id": 2005344, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8142cfe3/uploads/origins/ae6c0acb-4401-4936-b3cb-8bad56048c62?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3a80bacec00a9048a24eee274bce46db", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8142cfe3/uploads/origins/ae6c0acb-4401-4936-b3cb-8bad56048c62?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3a80bacec00a9048a24eee274bce46db, https://si.imgix.net/8142cfe3/uploads/origins/ae6c0acb-4401-4936-b3cb-8bad56048c62?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2be2627d579e2165799ef93bbf0fbb59 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8142cfe3/uploads/origins/ae6c0acb-4401-4936-b3cb-8bad56048c62?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ab1a18c9e9fc4415a68c0d1c410b8a39 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8142cfe3/uploads/origins/ae6c0acb-4401-4936-b3cb-8bad56048c62?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5b0af04ac0b0f368200e079027053461", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8142cfe3/uploads/origins/ae6c0acb-4401-4936-b3cb-8bad56048c62?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5b0af04ac0b0f368200e079027053461, https://si.imgix.net/8142cfe3/uploads/origins/ae6c0acb-4401-4936-b3cb-8bad56048c62?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1e4d3994ce14f29cdc753aa413eb3208 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8142cfe3/uploads/origins/ae6c0acb-4401-4936-b3cb-8bad56048c62?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d6170ed1cc017bb68bf1d181b9c286ab 3x"}, "body": "Hello! it is nice to meet you.\nI would love if you could draw my character \"Ahlani\".\nShe is a happy adventurer who has a mischievous and playful side. If I were to compare her to a genshin character you could think of her similar to \"Hu tao\" but not obsessed with death haha. (I am not sure what her Japanese name is but I hope you understand who I'm talking about).\nShe is from an icy place but she also loves eating food especially if it is sweet. \n\nhttps://sta.sh/263ai4qiomo?edit=1\nPlease note that her hair is black with a purple ombre.\nThis is an accurate reference to her. \nhttps://sta.sh/0qn6lf0wlcj\nPlease draw her in any outfit you feel like drawing her in. Even if it is not in my folder I would just be happy if you could draw her. \n\nI will leave pose and composition up to you thank you for you consideration! :)", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@moka_ko601/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2558852, "client_id": 2360196, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b912c2eb/uploads/origins/255c2103-711e-44a0-a769-575a9a95de5c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=948522e8919f1b2eae0ee91d3ae0d9f8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b912c2eb/uploads/origins/255c2103-711e-44a0-a769-575a9a95de5c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=948522e8919f1b2eae0ee91d3ae0d9f8, https://si.imgix.net/b912c2eb/uploads/origins/255c2103-711e-44a0-a769-575a9a95de5c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a824fb998a71163f7ff4150ca2aede4a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b912c2eb/uploads/origins/255c2103-711e-44a0-a769-575a9a95de5c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b1d88756f4e2c23b1f1f6e79c5929b7d 3x"}, "