n't have to be 16:9.)\n\nWe would appreciate your consideration.", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@moka_ko601/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2558852, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a48309da/uploads/origins/de55380c-5109-4126-8c5c-e5c76c2f6cd8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2bc966c522915d077b1c6fcfcc67cdce", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a48309da/uploads/origins/de55380c-5109-4126-8c5c-e5c76c2f6cd8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2bc966c522915d077b1c6fcfcc67cdce, https://si.imgix.net/a48309da/uploads/origins/de55380c-5109-4126-8c5c-e5c76c2f6cd8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3400e6eb148fec5a0df65c0c253b36d5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a48309da/uploads/origins/de55380c-5109-4126-8c5c-e5c76c2f6cd8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=53f9cce88b45c9b54832e0babb28ad93 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a48309da/uploads/origins/de55380c-5109-4126-8c5c-e5c76c2f6cd8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0c3e3589cfdda1f3d20b11e9ae6d9551", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a48309da/uploads/origins/de55380c-5109-4126-8c5c-e5c76c2f6cd8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0c3e3589cfdda1f3d20b11e9ae6d9551, https://si.imgix.net/a48309da/uploads/origins/de55380c-5109-4126-8c5c-e5c76c2f6cd8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=828f9591eb0ef4afa21303d91f097039 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a48309da/uploads/origins/de55380c-5109-4126-8c5c-e5c76c2f6cd8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=34578c5bc106378685a75fcdfdd110df 3x"}, "body": "桐ヶ谷 透子 from Bang Dream\n宵宮 from 原神\n\nI really like the way you draw chibi sprites. I wanted request a chibi style picture of these two characters setting off a firework. 桐ヶ谷 透子 is an energetic and very social gyaru who loves to have fun so I she'd be a good match to hang out with 宵宮. I'd like both girls to look excited and like they're having fun.", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@moka_ko601/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2558852, "client_id": 1757705, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/85aeb3af/uploads/origins/e5485fa8-3cab-422f-a8d4-1b76f3bd335d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=70d40cc97916d10aee317d641d0cc53e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/85aeb3af/uploads/origins/e5485fa8-3cab-422f-a8d4-1b76f3bd335d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=70d40cc97916d10aee317d641d0cc53e, https://si.imgix.net/85aeb3af/uploads/origins/e5485fa8-3cab-422f-a8d4-1b76f3bd335d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c53cd3a24080b30605e75d87dd140eb3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/85aeb3af/uploads/origins/e5485fa8-3cab-422f-a8d4-1b76f3bd335d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=21b7ac753eaae477f32513329fe106b3 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/85aeb3af/uploads/origins/e5485fa8-3cab-422f-a8d4-1b76f3bd335d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c7e7b0821b21ed1f9bc2a4220d9f3d33", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/85aeb3af/uploads/origins/e5485fa8-3cab-422f-a8d4-1b76f3bd335d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c7e7b0821b21ed1f9bc2a4220d9f3d33, https://si.imgix.net/85aeb3af/uploads/origins/e5485fa8-3cab-422f-a8d4-1b76f3bd335d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6ac28a101dcbf97012fcc50a3517b76c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/85aeb3af/uploads/origins/e5485fa8-3cab-422f-a8d4-1b76f3bd335d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=71ef9b10c1de6ffca0d0642105a6417b 3x"}, "body": "Hello, my name is Miyu Rurizuki, and I am a Vtuber.\nI think your cute illustrations are wonderful and I would be very happy to commission them from you.\nI will celebrate my birthday on January 23rd, and I was hoping to give my listeners a celebration as a net print.\nI was wondering if you could create an illustration of the image for me to give to my listeners as an online print.\n\nPurpose of use\nThumbnail of Youtube video and use in the video\nFor online printing\nWe will register for free online printing at Seven-Eleven, FamilyMart, and Lawson, and then print out the illustration on the Internet.\n　No money will be exchanged.\n\nIt would be greatly appreciated if you could provide us with a PSD of the background and another transparency material.\n\n■Image\nWe would like an illustration of a scene where you and your listeners are celebrating with a glass of wine.\nWe will leave the background to you. We have both new and old costumes, so please choose whichever you like best. (If it is too difficult, we can leave it to you to choose a party dress!)\n\n(If it is too difficult, we can leave it to you to choose the party dress! (If it is too difficult, just the normal version is OK.)\n\nI'm sorry for the length of this message, but thank you in advance for your cooperation.\n\n\n\n◆New Costume Materials\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/15sf1lsS4IBdsPasAevxi3t_1aL56yWK4\n\nOld costume materials\nhttps://twitter.com/RuritukiM/status/1519568080334368768", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "